      "message": "I\u0027m not sure that is worth doing. There\u0027s not an easy way for duplicate paths to be added as the dependencies structure is flat and cannot form a DAG. That is because while platform_bootclasspath can reference bootclasspath_fragments they can\u0027t reference each other. If duplicate paths could cause an issue then that should be handled by the script which detects conflicts when important.",
